# Keep the Docker build context small and safe. The demo container gets its
# source from a live bind mount (.:/workspace) and its deps/_build from named
# volumes — so excluding these here costs nothing at runtime and saves a large
# context transfer on every build.

# VCS + planning
.git
.gitignore
.planning
.claude
.gsd
.cursor

# Elixir build artifacts (come from named volumes at runtime, not the image)
_build
deps
**/_build
**/deps
*.ez
*.beam
erl_crash.dump
.elixir_ls
**/.elixir_ls
cover
**/cover

# Node / Playwright (installed in the image from package*.json, not copied in)
**/node_modules
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Compiled asset output (rebuilt in-container by the tailwind Hex binary)
**/priv/static/cache_manifest.json

# Platform-specific tailwind binaries must NEVER enter a Linux image — the Hex
# `tailwind` package auto-downloads the correct linux-<arch> binary in-container.
**/tailwind-macos-*
**/tailwind-darwin-*
**/tailwind-windows-*

# Scratch
tmp
**/tmp
test/tmp
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Local env overrides (never bake secrets/ports into the image)
.env
